    "quote": "<section class=\"tw xbox font-sm\" id=\"t2\"><h4 class=\"obj_head\">TABLE 2.</h4>\n<div class=\"caption p\"><p>Crotonyl-CoA-dependent NADH oxidation and ferredoxin reduction catalyzed by purified butyryl-CoA dehydrogenase/Etf complex from <em>C. kluyveri</em></p></div>\n<div class=\"tbl-box p\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"content\" frame=\"hsides\" rules=\"groups\">\n<thead><tr>\n<th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"center\" valign=\"bottom\">Assay mixture<a href=\"#t2fn1\" class=\"usa-link\"><sup><em>a</em></sup></a>\n</th>\n<th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"center\" valign=\"bottom\">Sp act (U/mg)</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"left\" valign=\"top\">NADH oxidation (measured photometrically)</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"left\" valign=\"top\">    No addition</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\">0.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"left\" valign=\"top\">    Fd</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\">4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"left\" valign=\"top\">    Hyd</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\">0.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"left\" valign=\"top\">    <strong>Fd + Hyd</strong>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\">\n<strong>7 (14)</strong><a href=\"#t2fn2\" class=\"usa-link\"><sup><em>a</em></sup></a>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"left\" valign=\"top\">    Fd + Hyd − crotonyl-CoA</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\">&lt;0.01</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"left\" valign=\"top\">    Fd + Hyd − FAD</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\">3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"left\" valign=\"top\">    <strong>Fd + Hyd − crotonyl-CoA + vinylacetyl-CoA</strong>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"><strong>8</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"left\" valign=\"top\">    Fd + Hyd + methyl viologen</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\">5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"left\" valign=\"top\">TTC reduction (measured photometrically)</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"left\" valign=\"top\">    TTC</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\">12</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"left\" valign=\"top\">    TTC + Fd</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\">10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"left\" valign=\"top\">    TTC + Fd + Hyd</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\">9</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"left\" valign=\"top\">    TTC − crotonyl-CoA</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\">0.6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"left\" valign=\"top\">Ferredoxin reduction (measured via H<sub>2</sub> formation in the presence of hydrogenase)</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"left\" valign=\"top\">    No addition</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\">&lt;0.01</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"left\" valign=\"top\">    Fd</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\">0.02</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"left\" valign=\"top\">    Hyd</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\">&lt;0.01</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"left\" valign=\"top\">    <strong>Fd + Hyd</strong>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"><strong>5</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"left\" valign=\"top\">    Fd + Hyd − crotonyl-CoA</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\">&lt;0.01</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"left\" valign=\"top\">    Fd + Hyd − FAD</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\">2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"left\" valign=\"top\">    <strong>Fd + Hyd − crotonyl-CoA + vinylacetyl-CoA</strong>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"><strong>4</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"left\" valign=\"top\">    Fd + Hyd + methyl viologen</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\">0.02</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<div class=\"p text-right font-secondary\"><a href=\"table/t2/\" class=\"usa-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open in a new tab</a></div>\n<div class=\"tw-foot p\">\n<div class=\"fn\" id=\"t2fn1\">\n<sup>a</sup><p class=\"display-inline\">Assays with activity are indicated by bold type. For NADH oxidation each 1-ml assay mixture incubated at 25°C contained 50 mM Tris-HCl (pH 7.5), 0.1 mM NADH, 0.1 mM crotonyl-CoA, 5 μM FAD, 2 mM DTT, 0.01 mg purified butyryl-CoA dehydrogenase/Etf complex, and, where indicated, 20 μM ferredoxin (Fd), 0.4 U hydrogenase (Hyd) from <em>C. pasteurianum</em>, and/or 1 mM methyl viologen. For TTC reduction each 1-ml assay mixture incubated at 25°C contained 50 mM Tris-HCl (pH 7.5), 0.2 mM NADH, 0.1 mM crotonyl-CoA, 5 μM FAD, 0.4 mM TTC, 2 mM DTT, 0.01 mg purified butyryl-CoA dehydrogenase/Etf complex, and, where indicated, 20 μM ferredoxin. For ferredoxin reduction each 0.5-ml assay mixture incubated at 37°C contained 50 mM Tris-HCl (pH 7.5), 2 mM DTT, 2.5 mM NADH, 1 mM crotonyl-CoA, 10 μM FAD, 0.05 mg purified butyryl-CoA dehydrogenase/Etf complex, and, where indicated, 50 μM ferredoxin, 1.6 U hydrogenase from <em>C. pasteurianum</em>, and/or 1 mM methyl viologen. The reactions were started by addition of crotonyl-CoA. One unit was equivalent to 1 μmol of NADH oxidized per min, 1 μmol of TTC reduced per min, or 1 μmol of H<sub>2</sub> formed per min.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fn\" id=\"t2fn2\">\n<sup>b</sup><p class=\"display-inline\">The specific activity at 37°C is indicated in parentheses. The NADH oxidation assay and the TTC reduction assay were routinely performed at 25°C, whereas the H<sub>2</sub> formation assay was performed at 37°C.</p>\n</div>\n</div></section>"
  },
